WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
 So, we made a thing together.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:05.980
 That'd be weird.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:06.600
 We made a thing.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.360
 In the car.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:08.840
 What are you saying?

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:10.900
 Cut that part out.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.220
 Just kidding.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.000
 But look, what's behind us?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.600
 There's a little rainbow.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.960
 Why do you have to sound like a kid?

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:22.980
 Because we're going to make one.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.240
 Many, many, many.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.320
 Right now.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:25.560
 Bye.

